        <cooldownMultiplier>0.9</cooldownMultiplier>
        <description>13 damage per hit. Faster slashes. Reach widens. Misdirection reaches "Low Clouds" intensity.</description>
        <levelComps>
          <li Class="AnimeArsenal.CompProperties_Cleave">
